ot specify the registry's system design, file organization techniques, storage media, programming languages, etc. to be used in its implementation.\nL44: ## General information\nL45: \nL46:   * Status\nL47: \nL48:  : Published\nL49: \nL50: Publication date\nL51: \nL52:  : 2023-01\nL53: \nL54: Stage\nL55: \nL56: : International Standard published [cite1†60.60 ]\nL57: \nL58:   * Edition\nL59: \nL60:  : 4\nL61: \nL62: Number of pages\nL63: \nL64:  : 40\nL65: \nL66:   * Technical Committee :\nL67: \nL68: cite2†ISO/IEC JTC 1/SC 32 L69: \nL70: ICS :\nL71: \nL72: cite3†35.040.50 L73: \nL74:   * cite4†RSS updates\nL75: \nL76: ## Life cycle\nL77: \nL78:   * ### Previously\nL79: \nL80: Withdrawn\nL81: \nL82: #### cite5†ISO/IEC 11179-6:2015 L83: \nL84:   * ### Now\nL85: \nL86: Published\nL87: #### ISO/IEC 11179-6:2023\nL88: \nL89: cite6†Stage: 60.60 L90: \nL91:     * 00\nL92: \nL93: Preliminary\nL94: \nL95:     * 10\nL96: \nL97: Proposal\nL98: \nL99:       * cite7†10.99 2019-07-02 New project approved L100:     * 20\nL101: \nL102: Preparatory\nL103: \nL104:       * cite8†20.00 2019-07-02 New project registered in TC/SC work programme L105:     * 30\nL106: \nL107: Committee\nL108: \nL109:       * cite9†30.00 2021-04-12 Committee draft (CD) registered L110:       * cite10†30.20 2021-04-13 CD consultation initiated L111:       * cite11†30.60 2021-06-09 Close of comment period L112:       * cite12†30.99 2022-01-25 CD approved for registration as DIS L113:     * 40\nL114: Enquiry\nL115: \nL116:       * cite13†40.00 2022-03-07 DIS registered L117:       * cite14†40.20 2022-05-09 DIS ballot initiated: 12 weeks L118:       * cite15†40.60 2022-08-02 Close of voting L119:       * cite16†40.99 2022-09-29 Full report circulated: DIS approved for registration as FDIS L120:     * 50\nL121: \nL122: Approval\nL123:       * cite17†50.00 2022-09-30 Final text received or FDIS registered for formal approval L124:       * cite18†50.20 2022-10-2